<title>POLAND: Polish housing output up 12.3 pct m/m in Sept.</title>
<headline>Polish housing output up 12.3 pct m/m in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of flats completed in September rose 12.3 percent from August but was 12.6-percent lower than in September 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said 4,108 flats were completed in September, bringing the total for the January-September period to 32,752 flats, or 81.9 percent of the number of flats finished in the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT     SEPTEMBER    AUGUST    SEPT 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	 12.3	-15.5	   N/A</p>
<p> number of flats built	 4,108	3,658	 4,613</p>
